---
import Card from '../Card.astro'
---

<Card colSpan="md:col-span-1" rowSpan="md:row-span-6" title="About me">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
    <p class="text-sm font-light">
      Hi, I'm Daniel, a backend and DevOps engineer.
      <br />
      <br />
      My primary tools of choice include:
      <ul class="list-inside list-disc">
        <li>Golang, JavaScript, TypeScript, PHP</li>
        <li>Docker, Kubernetes</li>
        <li>Nginx, Apache</li>
        <li>Databases (SQL/NoSQL)</li>
        <li>⁠AWS, Firebase, Supabase</li>
        <li>(Linux, Windows) OS</li>
        <li>⁠Postman/Swagger</li>
        <li>Bash scripting</li>
      </ul>
    </p>
    <p class="text-sm font-light">
      When I’m not glued to my keyboard, you’ll find me gaming, watching basketball, or exploring new places.
    </p>
  </div>
</Card>
